// Weather: rain and thunder (game.rs `weather_sounds`). Rain is two loops,
// light and heavy, crossfaded by how hard it rains where the camera looks;
// thunder follows each lightning flash after the time its sound takes to
// arrive (343 m a second), a crack when it struck close, a roll when far.
//
// Rain is noise by nature: kept soft on top (no hiss above ~5 kHz), made of
// many small separate drops over a low wash rather than one flat band, so it
// patters instead of sounding like static.
